        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-MJRP24-622, Matte Black 24 Inch Stainless Steel Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black 24 Inch Offset Pull has a sleek finish that brings out the modern design. This 24 Inch Matte Black Stainless Steel Offset Pull has a 1 x 1-1/2 inch grip and a 25-1/2 inch overall length. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This commercial door pull is suitable for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors--making it a great choice for use on storefronts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-MJRP24-specifications.gif?v=1704354548\" width=\"410\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-MJRP24-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/36-inch-matte-black-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp36-622\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp48-622\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>, or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-matte-black-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp60-622\"><b>60\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD MJRP24-622 Contemporary Black Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Tubular Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 25-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3-15/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Handle Dimensions: 1 x 1-1/2 (rectangular)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
